---
import Layout from '../layouts/layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Communication Programs"
  description="Christine Kahane offers Communication Skills and Motivations assessments to help you understand yourself, expand your leadership, and communicate more effectively."
>

  <!-- ============================================================
       HERO
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Communication Programs</span>
      <h1 class="page-title">Understand How<br><em>You Communicate.</em></h1>
      <p class="page-subhead">Science-backed assessment tools to expand your self-awareness, deepen your relationships, and unlock your leadership potential.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================
       PROGRAMS
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section-programs">
    <div class="container">

      <!-- Introductory Consultation -->
      <div class="program-row fade-up">
        <div class="program-left">
          <span class="program-num">01</span>
          <h2 class="program-title">Introductory Consultation</h2>
          <p class="program-tagline">Complimentary</p>
          <div class="program-meta">
            <div class="meta-item">
              <span class="meta-label">Duration</span>
              <span class="meta-value">1 hour</span>
            </div>
            <div class="meta-item">
              <span class="meta-label">Investment</span>
              <span class="meta-value">Free</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Book Now</a>
        </div>
        <div class="program-right">
          <p>This complimentary hour is yours — to share what's on your mind, and ask any questions you have about the process. We'll discuss how my coaching approach works for you.</p>
          <p>We'll spend time so you begin to get clear on what your coaching goals are. We'll explore how we'll work together, which program will help you transform how your life works, and how you'll achieve the outcomes that will liberate you.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Improve Your Communication Skills -->
      <div class="program-row program-row--featured fade-up">
        <div class="program-left">
          <span class="program-num">02</span>
          <h2 class="program-title">Improve Your Communication Skills</h2>
          <p class="program-tagline">Communications & Behavior Profile</p>
          <div class="program-meta">
            <div class="meta-item">
              <span class="meta-label">Format</span>
              <span class="meta-value">Assessment + Sessions</span>
            </div>
            <div class="meta-item">
              <span class="meta-label">Best for</span>
              <span class="meta-value">Leadership & Growth</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Book Now</a>
        </div>
        <div class="program-right">
          <p>This assessment brings together your communications and behavior styles and preferences in a full range profile. We'll work with its many tools to assist you in understanding and expanding your communications skill.</p>
          <p>You'll increase your understanding of how others perceive you, and gain ways to communicate effectively with others.</p>
          <div class="program-includes">
            <span class="includes-label">Ideal for</span>
            <div class="include-item">Leadership development at any level</div>
            <div class="include-item">Growth in any area of life</div>
            <div class="include-item">Teams seeking better collaboration</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Harness Your Motivations -->
      <div class="program-row fade-up">
        <div class="program-left">
          <span class="program-num">03</span>
          <h2 class="program-title">Harness Your Motivations</h2>
          <p class="program-tagline">DiSC Profile Extension</p>
          <div class="program-meta">
            <div class="meta-item">
              <span class="meta-label">Format</span>
              <span class="meta-value">Assessment + Sessions</span>
            </div>
            <div class="meta-item">
              <span class="meta-label">Best for</span>
              <span class="meta-value">Teams & Families</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Book Now</a>
        </div>
        <div class="program-right">
          <p>This assessment builds on your DiSC profile to give you further insight into the aspects of your personality and behavior preferences.</p>
          <p>We'll work with what motivates you — and what doesn't — so you'll have access to a deeper well of choices in working with people and situations.</p>
          <div class="program-includes">
            <span class="includes-label">Recommended for</span>
            <div class="include-item">Team development</div>
            <div class="include-item">Family and relational contexts</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================
       CTA
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section-cta">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-inner">
        <h2 class="cta-title">Not sure where to start?</h2>
        <p class="cta-body">Begin with a complimentary consultation. Christine will help you identify which assessment and program is the right fit for where you are right now.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary-light">Book a Free Consultation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  :root {
    --gold:         #C4922A;
    --silver:       #8C9490;
    --limestone:    #EEF2F1;
    --warm-white:   #F4F7F6;
    --warm-white-2: #EFF3F2;
    --green:        #18332F;
    --green-mid:    #1f4038;
    --body-color:   #2C3A4A;
    --muted:        #5C7068;
    --divider:      rgba(24, 51, 47, 0.1);
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2.5rem;
  }

  /* ── Shared ── */
  .eyebrow {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  p {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 0.97rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.9;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #fff;
    background: var(--green);
    padding: 0.9rem 1.75rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--green-mid); color: #fff; }

  .btn-primary-light {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--green);
    background: #fff;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.75rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .btn-primary-light:hover { background: var(--limestone); }

  /* ── Hero ── */
  .page-hero {
    background: var(--limestone);
    padding: 80px 0 70px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--divider);
  }

  .page-title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5vw, 4.2rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--green);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .page-title em {
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .page-subhead {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.8vw, 1.2rem);
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--green-mid);
    opacity: 0.85;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* ── Programs ── */
  .section-programs {
    background: var(--warm-white);
    padding: 80px 0 100px;
  }

  .program-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.6fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: start;
    padding: 3.5rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--divider);
  }

  .program-row:first-child {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--divider);
  }

  .program-row--featured {
    background: #fff;
    margin: 0 -2.5rem;
    padding: 3.5rem 2.5rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--gold);
  }

  .program-left {
    position: sticky;
    top: 80px;
  }

  .program-num {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .program-title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2vw, 1.6rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--green);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .program-tagline {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--silver);
    font-style: italic;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  .program-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border: 0.5px solid var(--divider);
  }

  .meta-item {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.65rem 0.9rem;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--divider);
    background: #fff;
  }
  .meta-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  .meta-label {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--silver);
  }

  .meta-value {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--green);
  }

  .program-includes {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--divider);
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  .includes-label {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .include-item {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--body-color);
    line-height: 1.7;
    padding: 0.4rem 0 0.4rem 1rem;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--divider);
    position: relative;
  }

  .include-item::before {
    content: '—';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--gold);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }

  .include-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  /* ── CTA ── */
  .section-cta {
    background: var(--green);
    padding: 80px 0;
  }

  .cta-inner { max-width: 600px; }

  .cta-title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.4rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .cta-body {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 0.97rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
    line-height: 1.9;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  /* ── Responsive ── */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .program-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }

    .program-left { position: static; }

    .program-row--featured {
      margin: 0 -1.5rem;
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .section-programs { padding: 60px 0; }
    .container { padding: 0 1.5rem; }
  }
</style>